{"channelId":"UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","row":["Harbin SHS Animal Rescue",270,"We're a registered 501c3 non-profit (EIN 83-4274095). \n\nFounded by 3 girls from Australia, England and Ireland, whilst living in China. We're just trying to save as many animals as we possibly can, and bring greater animal welfare and support to Harbin and the surrounding areas in China. Working with locals and the authorities to make it a safer, kinder and happier place for all species. \n\nWe have been rescuing in China for over 8 years. \n\nOur Instagram is  @Slaughterhouse_survivors for daily content and live videos.\n\nWe have over 1000 animals currently in our care at our Safehouse facility:\n\nVisit our website for more info:\nhttps://linktr.ee/harbinshs\n\nThank you for your support!\n\nVolunteer email: volunteer@harbinshs \n\nSupport email: support@harbinshs.com\n\nVenmo: @harbinshs \n\nPaypal: Support@harbinshs.com\n\nAdoptions email: adoptions@harbinshs.com","support@harbinshs.com; adoptions@harbinshs.com","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:44.286Z","channelId":"UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"6982476c331632379ed244ab5369405df35952dadc3d3dc24109dc6ca53e5e00","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"df6035f2e7736836fd6f88fdee09c3309c91c709f2833662560d7d3dbe226396"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:44.286Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":270,"raw":"270 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCosEGDMwmcqdF1h_VVm1W8g","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:44.286Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"support@harbinshs.com","purpose":"support",